# Normalise everything to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This repo is authored on Windows but its scripts run on Linux — inside the
# distroless image, and via `docker exec` into kind nodes. A shell script
# checked out with CRLF fails there with `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M`,
# which is an obscure way to discover a line-ending problem. Forcing LF makes
# a clone behave identically on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish files git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pprof binary
*.exe binary
